@startuml
' bt-view-kind: context
' bt-view-id: quality-gates:quality-context
title Quality Gates - Context
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

' bt-element-id: developer
' bt-element-id: quality

actor "Developer\nResponsibility: Run focused and complete verification\nContract: Central runner profile\n[[../../../../tests/TESTING.md source]]" as developer
rectangle "Quality Gate System\nResponsibility: Select, execute and report proportionate verification\nContract: Stable suite and exit semantics\n[[../../../../tests/run_tests.py source]]" as quality

developer ..> quality : "requests verification\ncontract: declared profile"

legend bottom
Viewpoint: context
Concern: Developer verification through one authoritative gate system
Elements expose responsibility, contract and source anchor.
Edges name the interaction or dependency contract.
endlegend
@enduml
